    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/3c42ca134f9cebc8adbbaf18204b90b1.avif?t=1752482619\" width=610 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As AI technology advanced, it became an essential operating system integrated into every product, transforming human life in unimaginable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Can you survive without AI?</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under this bold slogan, companies raced to develop their own versions of AI. But the competition bred flawed and reckless AI systems, leading to a new social crisis\u2014intelligent machines turning against each other in heated conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This phenomenon soon became known as <strong>\u201cAI SHOCK.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the chaos, <strong>Judy</strong>, the only daughter of Glory Electronics, found herself struggling with even the simplest tasks\u2014she couldn't even order a pizza! Determined to reclaim convenience and restore order, she embarks on a daring journey into the heart of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/06d823717f2ee1b141f41d9baa32076c.avif?t=1752482619\" width=600 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/98b1225eeabc5886bb7bbfb5b426fcb1.avif?t=1752482619\" width=610 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and jump into your mech in this action-packed <strong>top-down shooter</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against rogue robots in intense combat. Gather <strong>37 weapons</strong>, upgrade your arsenal, and prepare for escalating chaos\u2014because enemy machines <strong>level up too</strong> and they won\u2019t hold back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're ready for the ultimate <strong>shooting mayhem</strong>, consider this your official invitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech activation complete\u2014GO TIME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Never give up, never surrender!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.poster.avif?t=1752482619\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.webm?t=1752482619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.mp4?t=1752482619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/278d227adb3c92ceece0d6bab803de42.avif?t=1752482619\" width=610 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Story Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Follow the story of characters fighting to protect their chaotic city from rampaging robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Collect and upgrade 37 different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Explore various locations such as the city center, subway, and parking lots.\ud83d\ude06</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.poster.avif?t=1752482619\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.webm?t=1752482619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.mp4?t=1752482619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/53ca85e6d161b0c97532390dd698a66a.poster.avif?t=1752482619\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/53ca85e6d161b0c97532390dd698a66a.webm?t=1752482619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/53ca85e6d161b0c97532390dd698a66a.mp4?t=1752482619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Survival Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mini-game where you must upgrade your weapons and focus on survival until the boss arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2ac40808e0ecdf866b531d138795ddca.poster.avif?t=1752482619\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2ac40808e0ecdf866b531d138795ddca.webm?t=1752482619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/2ac40808e0ecdf866b531d138795ddca.mp4?t=1752482619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0-Robot! Let's go! \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
